  "body_text": "CATALYST\nCREATED BY MONKEYZOO\nRisk Disclosure\nReview the live trading risks before connecting your wallet\nRISK DISCLOSURE\nRead this before connecting your wallet\nThis app creates, cancels, and broadcasts real offers using your Sage wallet. It automates pricing, coin prep, requoting, and fill handling, but cannot remove the risks of live trading.\nTrading risks\nPrice shocks, stale data, wallet lag, and failed cancels can leave you with unexpected exposure or losses.\nOperator responsibility\nReview settings, monitor live trading, and stop the bot if wallet or market behavior looks wrong.\nThird-party dependency risk\nSage, Dexie, Splash, Coinset, and Spacescan are external. CATalyst degrades safely when attributable evidence becomes incomplete.\nNo guarantee\nThis is an operator tool, not financial advice. Use at your own risk and start small until you trust the behavior.\nBy continuing, you acknowledge these risks and accept responsibility for using this software with your wallet and funds.\nContinue to wallet connection\nClose app\nCATALYST\nAPP V1.4.0\nIDLE\nBootstrap expired — stop campaign before renewal · b8edcc6a7cf3… · revision 1\nOVERVIEW\nDashboard\n\nYour live command centre for startup, wallet state, activity, risk, and market behaviour.\n\nBootstrap expired — stop campaign before renewal · b8edcc6a7cf3… · revision 1 · stop campaign before restart or renewal · corridor 0.0000375–0.00015 XCH/MZ\nQUICK START\nSet up this trading pair before you start the bot\n\nChoose the CAT pair, review your settings, and confirm coin prep. The dashboard below stays focused until the bot is live.\n\nTRADING PAIR\n-- Choose a Trading Pair --\nMZ (MZ) [resumed]\nRefresh\nReview Settings\nCurrent pair: MZ (MZ). Balances, market data, and settings now follow this selection.\nWallet\nWaiting for Sage wallet connection.\nTrading Pair\nMZ (MZ) selected.\nSettings\nUse Review Settings and save your setup for this run.\nCoin Prep\nSave settings to verify coin sizes for this pair.\nStart\nBootstrap campaign expired — campaign-owned offers require cancellation before restart or renewal.\n▶ Start\n⏹ Stop\nNo Offers To Cancel\n● STOPPED\nDisconnected\n⚡\nSage\n🔑\nConnect ▸\n?\nOFFER-BOOK MARKET CONFIDENCE\nSOURCES · DEXIE / SPLASH / SAGE / CHAIN\nGathering attributable offer-book evidence\nVOLUME & TOKEN INFO\nSOURCE · DEXIE\nSelect a trading pair to load volume data\nACTIVE SETTINGS\n?\nTRADING\nBuy / Sell\n?\nChoose pair\nLoop\n?\n—\nMax Offers\n?\n—\nSPREADS\nMode\n?\nChoose pair\nBase\n?\n—\nRange\n?\n—\nMin Edge\n?\n—\nINVENTORY\nSkew\n?\nPENDING\nMax Position\n?\n—\nTIERS\nEnabled\n?\nPENDING\nSizes\n?\n—\nSAFETY\nReserves\n?\nChoose pair\nPrice Limits\n?\n—\nCircuit Breaker\n?\nPENDING\nMARKET HEALTH\n?\n...\nChoose a trading pair to load balances and market data.\nSelect a CAT pair above, then open Settings to prepare that token for this run.\nINNER SPREAD ?\nloading\nMARKET SPREAD ?\nloading\nCOMPETITORS ?\nloading\nCONFIDENCE STATE ?\nloading\nREQUIRED INDEPENDENT DEPTH ?\nloading\nFILL RATE ?\npending\nVOLATILITY ?\npending\nPOSITION ?\npending\nTRADING PACE ?\npending\nWITHDRAWAL STAGE ?\npending\nCB BLOCKED ?\npending\nTOXICITY ?\npending\nACTIVITY LEVEL ?\npending\nON-CHAIN RISK ?\npending\nHOLDERS ?\npending\nDexie Orderbook\nSpacescan\nWALLET & PERFORMANCE\n?\nRefresh\nSAGE WALLET\nXCH Spendable\n?\n0.0000\nXCH Total\n?\n0.0000\nSelect a pair to see token balances\nRESERVES ?\nXCH\nChoose pair\nCAT\nChoose pair\nPERFORMANCE\nUptime\n?\n00:00:00\nLoops\n?\n0\nLast Loop\n?\n0.00s\nTotal Fills\n?\n0\nFill Rate\n?\n0.0/hr\nPnL\n?\n+0.000 XCH\nErrors\n?\n0",
